Subject: [PATCH] Add forever COS avatar GET/PUT on existing bakery-drinks.

Store the look on a Square customer custom attribute so Cloud Run
scale-to-zero does not wipe it. File store stays for laptop tests.
No new GCP service and no InventoryCounts.
